GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# ...with one deliberate exception. dev-debug.keystore signs DEBUG builds only,
# and it is committed so that every developer's `flutter run` carries the same
# signature and therefore the same registered SHA-1 in Google Cloud. Without it
# each machine signs with its own generated debug key and Google refuses the
# sign-in. It can publish nothing (Play rejects debug keys) and its password is
# the documented constant `android`, so it is not a secret in any useful sense.
# The RELEASE key is the one the lines above protect, and it stays protected.
!/dev-debug.keystore
